   "source": [
    "# Baseline QC app — launch inline\n",
    "\n",
    "Run this cell in Jupyter to render the app in the notebook output. The app reads sessions from `/root/capsule/scratch/first_try` and writes curation to `curation.csv` in the same directory.\n",
    "\n",
    "Keyboard shortcuts (when no input is focused):\n",
    "- `J` / `K` — previous / next ROI\n",
    "- `S` — save current decision\n",
    "- `Space` — save and advance to next ROI\n",
    "\n",
    "To run as a standalone web app instead:\n",
    "\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "panel serve /root/capsule/code/qc_app/app.py --port 5006 \\\n",
    "    --address 0.0.0.0 --allow-websocket-origin='*'\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import sys\n",
    "sys.path.insert(0, '/root/capsule/code')\n",
    "import panel as pn\n",
    "pn.extension(notifications=True, design='material')\n",
    "\n",
    "from qc_app.app import build_app\n",
    "app = build_app()\n",
    "app"
   ]
  }
